{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.poster.avif?t=1771610930\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.webm?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.mp4?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with friends or go solo as you scavenge loot across a massive, monster-infested archipelago. Work together to succeed against overwhelming odds, grab as much loot as you can, and escape in style by surfing a massive tsunami wave to become the most legendary surfer-pirates of the sea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF, SHRED, SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your high-speed \u201cRushboard\u201d to hop between islands and tow your loot barge around procedurally generated tropical islands. Choose from multiple objective types, where each one has you exploring and looting while managing increasing pressure from enemies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/b37b7194ad032f0db2b64542edef3435.poster.avif?t=1771610930\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/b37b7194ad032f0db2b64542edef3435.webm?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/b37b7194ad032f0db2b64542edef3435.mp4?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 UNIQUE WEAPON CLASSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from four distinct weapon classes, each with their own flashy moves and strategic roles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword</strong> \u2013 A fast and versatile melee weapon that allows for double dashes and packs a powerful punch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistols</strong> \u2013 Fast-firing long-range weapons with explosive attacks. and the ability to jump up cliffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anchor </strong>\u2013 A versatile heavy weapon that can switch between two stances and be used to pull teammates up cliffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guitar</strong> \u2013 An unconventional support weapon with timing-based bonuses, powerful AOE attacks and the ability to speed-boost allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ef7a73a3ac1852f0e5744ba111f7225a.poster.avif?t=1771610930\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ef7a73a3ac1852f0e5744ba111f7225a.webm?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ef7a73a3ac1852f0e5744ba111f7225a.mp4?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ON THE GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources mid-run to craft gadgets like ladders, explosives, and makeshift boards. Break through barriers, improvise escape routes, or set traps for enemies. Quick thinking and creativity turn the tide of every mission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE OR WIPEOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you extract more loot, enemies become stronger as time passes. When the islands start shaking and the water rises, you\u2019ll have to make your escape before a colossal tsunami swallows everything. Navigate obstacles and surf your way back to safety, with your barge full, if you\u2019re lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ec1cbef2eeb02397eda12e95efcc8216.poster.avif?t=1771610930\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ec1cbef2eeb02397eda12e95efcc8216.webm?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/ec1cbef2eeb02397eda12e95efcc8216.mp4?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANG OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return your plunder to the Beastship: your floating home on the seas. Share your loot with the onboard crew to craft new weapons, enhance your gear, customize your looks, and unlock new abilities. The Beastship also offers a place to pick up some side quests for unique loot or just hang out in between missions as you discover the world of <i>Surfpunk</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVER-CHANGING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dozens of procedurally generated islands in each quest, teeming with enemies to battle, secrets to discover and loot to scavenge. Each journey sends you into a dynamic world teeming with unique events and challenges. No two sessions are the same!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2434830?t=1771610930","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/5f941c7830517791ba8888da07d74a8699f47692/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771610930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/93b7c33e3d8d337ed7e1606c5bd27b9447bd51e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771610930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/93b7c33e3d8d337ed7e1606c5bd27b9447bd51e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771610930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4225130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.poster.avif?t=1771610930\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.webm?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/3b0003ca1bd1884f3b91062a6dd8150e.mp4?t=1771610930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with friends or go solo as you scavenge loot across a massive, monster-infested archipelago. Work together to succeed against overwhelming odds, grab as much loot as you can, and escape in style by surfing a massive tsunami wave to become the most legendary surfer-pirates of the sea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF, SHRED, SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your h